invariant: INV-5
file: x509_ca.c
catches: x509strict
reason: accepting a keyUsage without keyCertSign pins an anchor whose own
  certificate says the key may not sign certificates — the rule x509.c
  applies to every chain intermediate, dropped on the provisioning side

--- old
        return x509_read_keyusage(ext->value, ext->value_len, KEY_CERT_SIGN) != 0;
--- new
        return 1;
